OL,3,GNEWSASpook-tacular Derry Halloween
OL,4,Afestival turns 40
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,7,Fexpected in Londonderry this week as
OL,8,Fthe city celebrates the 40th
OL,9,Fanniversary of its Halloween festival.
OL,11,FFrom humble beginnings in the mid
OL,12,F1980s, the festival is - according to
OL,13,Fthe organisers, Derry City and Strabane
OL,14,FDistrict Council - Europe's largest
OL,15,FHalloween Festival.
OL,17,FMayor of Derry Grace Ui Niallais said
OL,18,Fthe festival, which gets under way on
OL,19,FWednesday, has grown to become "one of
OL,20,FIreland's most famous cultural events".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
