OL,3,GNEWSASpook-tacular Derry Halloween
OL,4,Afestival turns 40
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year the city celebrates 40 years
OL,7,Fof the festival with events inspired by
OL,8,Ffolklore, mythology and the traditions
OL,9,Fof Samhain, the ancient festival in
OL,10,Fwhich Halloween's roots lie.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
